  "locations": [
    {
      "name": "The Village",
      "description": "A small village on a river bend: a lane of houses, each belonging to one of your characters; a tavern with a long table; a smithy under a chestnut tree; a trading post; an alchemist's shop with a green door; two guild halls facing each other across the square; a healer's house with a garden; an animal handler's yard at the edge of the fields; and the Village Hall, whose walls hold the mementos of finished campaigns."
